## @file
#  R8Q Platform Package Declaration File
#
#  Target Platform: Samsung Galaxy S20 FE 5G (SM-G781B / r8q)
#  SoC: Qualcomm Snapdragon 865 (SM8250)
#
#  Values in this DEC are either source-verified SoC/controller addresses or
#  explicitly marked candidates. See docs/VERIFICATION_LEDGER.md. A PCD is not
#  a hardware guarantee; runtime validation is still required.
